 "description": "What maintenance is due across the user's current grinders and machines, most urgent first \u2014 for \"is anything due?\". Only tasks with an interval compete: a task the machine counts and signals itself, one done by habit or when a symptom shows, and one the maker advises against never appear. Each item says how far along it is (ratio, done of every, on which basis) and whether the interval is the user's, the maker's or ShotPulled's default.",
